        "metaphor": "Think of it as our private high-performance utility closet. Instead of paying Amazon or Google $150 every month to rent a computer in the cloud, we have a whisper-quiet, ultra-fast mini-PC running 24/7 in our home that handles all our heavy databases, scrapers, and background jobs for pennies of electricity.",
        "box1": "Our Local Network / Tailscale Mesh (Secure private tunnel from any laptop/phone)",
        "box2": "Docker Containers (Independent mini-computers running our database, scrapers, and APIs)",
        "box3": "Persistent SSD Storage (All our leads, transcripts, and AI memories stay 100% private and owned by us)",
