            "It runs Docker containers that handle all our heavy scrapers and databases without cloud hosting bills.",
            "We connect to it securely through our private encrypted mesh, so it works anywhere in the world."
        ],
        "freeze_point": "If someone asks: 'Why not just host this on Vercel or AWS?'\nAnswer: 'Cost and control. Running intensive 24/7 background scrapers and 6,000+ lead databases locally costs virtually zero dollars and eliminates cloud usage fees.'"
    },
    "dynamic": {
        "title": "Dynamic Architecture (Zero-Hardcoding Law)",
        "metaphor": "Hardcoding is like writing a grocery list on stone tablets—every time you want to buy milk, you have to chisel a new rock. Dynamic architecture is like having a smart basket that automatically counts whatever you toss into it. If we add 5 new cities tomorrow, the system discovers them automatically without touching a single line of code.",
        "box1": "File System & Database Discovery (Auto-detecting installed scrapers and active data rows)",
        "box2": "Dynamic Serialization API (Serializes whatever exists instead of a static list)",
